\node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.55,2.7) {Yusuf};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Otto's median ($30$) is slightly higher than Yusuf's median ($28$), so Otto's typical score is a little higher.
Otto's box, from $15$ to $35$, is much wider than Yusuf's box, from $25$ to $32$.
Yusuf is far more consistent, even though his best score is lower than Otto's.

