\draw[black,dashed,thin] (3.8,0)--(3.8,3.5);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Team X never scored more than $38$ points in any set, while Team Y never scored fewer than $38$ points.
So Team Y's worst set was at least as good as Team X's best set — their scores just touch at $38$, and every Team Y score is at least as high as every Team X score.
